# Reproduction fingerprints depend on exact Python source bytes.
* -text
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
*.py -text
*.png -text
*.blend -text
# Markdown's intentional two-space line breaks are not whitespace defects.
*.md whitespace=space-before-tab,cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-blank-at-eol
